<title>USA: Louisiana-Pacific to sell land for $50 mln.</title>
<headline>Louisiana-Pacific to sell land for $50 mln.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Louisiana-Pacific Corp said it reached an agreement in principle to sell about 38,000 acres of timberland in northern California to Sierra-Pacific Industries for $50 million.</p>
</text>
